  "id": "negative-feedback",
  "term": "negative feedback",
  "definition": "Negative feedback is information from another person that critically evaluates someone’s work, performance, or personal characteristics. In learning contexts, it is an external signal that can influence motivation, thinking, and behavior, and may weaken overly positive beliefs such as self-deception.",
